iscrepancies generate complaints that consume more resources than the premium they’re arguing about, and renewal processing starts later than anyone is comfortable with."}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"The operation manages risk for a living. But the operational risks it carries inside its own processes — the delays, the inconsistencies, the invisible rework — are often larger than anyone has measured."}]]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-20 bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-navy-900 mb-6","children":["PROCESSES: ","INSURANCE"," OPERATIONS"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gold-600 h-1 w-24 mb-12"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Submission Intake & Clearance"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Receiving, logging, and clearing new business submissions and renewal requests. The process that determines whether underwriting starts with clean data or starts with cleanup."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Risk Assessment & Underwriting"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Evaluating risk characteristics, applying rating algorithms, and making acceptance decisions. The process where risk appetite meets operational capacity — and where inconsistency between underwriters creates unpredictable results."}]]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$